---
title: "get_rounds GET /v1/integration/rounds (Legion Backend API)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: api_key = headers["x-api-key"]
    q_auth --> q_check_key: api_key valid
    q_check_key --> q_sign: identifier = context_id
    q_check_key --> q_reject: api_key invalid
    q_reject --> [*]: revert "unauthorized"
    q_sign --> q_compute_sig: signature = HMAC_SHA256(secret_key, identifier)
    q_compute_sig --> q_send: GET /v1/integration/rounds with X-Signature
    q_send --> q_parse: response = server_response
    q_parse --> q_success: response.status == 2xx
    q_parse --> q_error: response.status != 2xx
    q_success --> [*]: return rounds_list
    q_error --> [*]: revert "fetch rounds failed"

    note right of q_sign
        INV-001: GET requests sign an identifier, not the URL path
        INV-002: returns only currently active investment rounds
        INV-003: round data includes round ID needed for subsequent operations
    end note
